          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Smaller commercial jobs under 15,000 square feet can be applied with commercial squeegees and hand tools using products like Jetcoat Commercial Grade or AGS Acrylic Fortified. Larger commercial lots typically require commercial spray equipment for efficient, even application. Most DOT-specification products are designed for contractor application.",
