            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Commercial asphalt sealers require surface and air temperatures between 50°F and 90°F during application and for at least 24 hours afterward. Large commercial lots should be sealed when dry weather is forecast for 48-72 hours, as commercial spray application is more sensitive to rain washout than small-area residential work.",
