            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes, for jobs under 15,000 square feet. A commercial rubber squeegee with extension handles can achieve professional results at a fraction of the equipment cost. For larger commercial jobs, spray application is practically required for efficiency and consistent coverage. A two-person squeegee crew can seal approximately 10,000 square feet per day, while a commercial spray rig can cover 50,000-100,000 square feet in the same time frame.",
          },
        },
      ],
