          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">
            Commercial Asphalt Sealing Costs: What to Budget
          </h2>

          <p>
            Understanding the cost structure of commercial asphalt sealing helps property managers and contractors make accurate budget projections and evaluate contractor bids. Commercial sealing costs vary significantly based on lot size, product specification, surface condition, and labor market, but these benchmarks provide a working framework.
